Package: bayestrials
Title: A Comprehensive Framework for Reproducible Bayesian Clinical Trial Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aartik", "Sarma", email = "aartik.sarma@ucsf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package for reproducible Bayesian analyses of clinical 
    datasets using brms. The package enables systematic prior specification in a 
    standardized tibble format, supports multiple model configurations (Gaussian, 
    Binomial, Poisson, etc.), and provides automated model fitting with parallel 
    processing. Features include comprehensive convergence diagnostics, rich 
    visualizations, automated report generation, and robust model comparison 
    capabilities for clinical trial analyses.
